#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "sgetmask, ssetmask - manipulation of signal mask (obsolete)"
msgstr "sgetmask, ssetmask - Manipuler les masquages de signaux (obsolète)"

